  <ThingDef Name="Berserker" ParentName="BasePawn">
    <defName>GOW_Berserker</defName>
    <label>berserker</label>
    <description>A rare breed of Locust, Berserkers spend most of their lives in securely guarded holding cells deep in the Nexus, with their sole task being birthing new Locust for the Horde. It is unclear if Berserkers are naturally violent or become so through the mistreatment they receive by their own kind but what is known is that due to this extreme rage they are utterly incapable of speech or reasoning, at best barely being kept docile until they are needed. Although uncommon, the Horde has been known in times of desperation or tactical advantage to unchain a Berserker and let them loose on the surface, acting as effective terror weapons.</description>
